  "title": {
   "en": "Gazing at the Azure"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "瑠璃をみる"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Ruri wo Miru"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Long, long ago, there were two orphan brothers, Ogna and Syra. To make a living, they spend their days tending to the fields and raising silkworms. One day, the younger brother, Syra, starts to be concerned about beauty and what it means to be beautiful, much to his older brother's chagrin. A rift begins to form between the two brothers when Syra encounters someone in a lake, someone who loves him for his beauty...\n\nSerialized in the infamous *June*, this one-shot has never been reprinted or collected in any tankobon."
  },
